      "line": 44,
      "sourceId": "0063:000044",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「人にあまり見られないように」",
      "english": "“So people won't see me.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0063:000046",
      "line": 46,
      "sourceId": "0063:000046",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　静寂。",
      "english": "Silence.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0063:000047",
      "line": 47,
      "sourceId": "0063:000047",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　あずさには選ぶ言葉もない。\n　ぱくぱくと口を開閉する。",
      "english": "Azusa could find no words. Her mouth opened and closed soundlessly.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0063:000048",
      "line": 48,
      "sourceId": "0063:000048",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　表情一つ変えずに忍は見ている。\n　視線の、圧力。",
      "english": "Shinobu watched her without the slightest change of expression. The pressure of his gaze.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0063:000049",
      "line": 49,
      "sourceId": "0063:000049",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　それがあずさを押し潰すことに、忍はようやく気\nづいた。",
      "english": "Only then did Shinobu realize that his gaze was crushing Azusa.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0063:000050",
      "line": 50,
      "sourceId": "0063:000050",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「人に、言う？」",
      "english": "“Will you tell anyone?”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0063:000052",
      "line": 52,
      "sourceId": "0063:000052",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　かける必要のない声をかけた。\n　あずさはスイッチが入ったかのように首を振る。",
      "english": "He had asked a question that did not need asking. Azusa shook her head as though a switch had been flipped.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0063:000053",
      "line": 53,
      "sourceId": "0063:000053",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「ならいい」",
      "english": "“Then it's fine.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0063:000055",
      "line": 55,
      "sourceId": "0063:000055",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　歩き出す。\n　少女の脇を通り過ぎて、施設に―――",
      "english": "He started walking again. Past the girl and toward the facility—",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
