      "line": 67,
      "sourceId": "0063:000067",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　瞬間的に、あずさは赤面する。\n　まともに忍を見ることができなくなったのか、う\nつむく。",
      "english": "Azusa's face flushed in an instant. Unable, perhaps, to look Shinobu in the eye, she bowed her head.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
