      "line": 79,
      "sourceId": "0063:000079",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　刹那、心を蒲色が曖昧に灼いた。",
      "english": "For one fleeting instant, a hazy russet heat scorched his heart.",
